# Used by BuildKit for workload-generator/Dockerfile. The build context is the repository root, because the
# runner embeds scenarios/ and database/common/:  docker build --file workload-generator/Dockerfile .
# Send only what the build needs.
*
!scenarios
!database
!workload-generator
database/*
!database/common
workload-generator/tests
workload-generator/out
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/*.md